-- The following INSERT statements are meant for a test scenario where the duplicate‐insertion in table2 is allowed (for example, by temporarily disabling the primary key constraint) so that we can demonstrate the difference between the two queries.

-- Inserting two rows into table2 with the same value (duplicate entries)
